This package interacts with web services operated by ANAF (Agenția Națională de
Administrare Fiscală) and the Romanian Ministry of Finance. It is an independent,
unofficial client and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by ANAF or
the Ministry of Finance.

Reference material under docs/anaf-reference/_sources/ is reproduced from official
ANAF / Ministry of Finance publications and remains the property of its respective
authors; it is included for reference only.

